flowchart TD
  accTitle: Observe Worker Recovery flow
  accDescr {
    An encrypted archive is authenticated, restored in an isolated disposable namespace, and
    used to start workers, verify readiness, replay a test carrier, and confirm duplicate
    recognition while preserving records and inbox counts. Nonempty queues block
    verification.
  }
  A[Encrypted cloud archive] --> B[Authenticate archive]
  B --> C[Restore in disposable namespace]
  C --> D[Restore roles, permissions, worker tables, broker topology, app]
  D --> E[Rewrite dependency addresses and broker test credentials]
  E --> F[Start real worker and restored dependencies]
  F --> G[Require readiness]
  G --> H[Replay schema-valid test carrier]
  H --> I[Verify duplicate recognition]
  I --> J[Preserve original record and inbox count]
  J --> K[Recovery and replay safety confirmed]
  A -. if queues nonempty .-> L[Verification blocked]
  C -. loopback only / no prod sockets .-> M[Isolation enforced]
